(326, 'baboon', 'Baboon', 'Бабуин', 'small', 'beast', 12, 3, '1d6', 'walk 30 ft., climb 30 ft.', 14, 0, '0', 10, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{"name":"Bite","desc":"Melee Weapon Attack: +1 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 1 (1d4 - 1) piercing damage.","attack_bonus":1,"damage":"1d4-1 piercing"}]', 'Pack Tactics. The baboon has advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the baboon''s allies is within 5 ft. of the creature and the ally isn''t incapacitated.', 'https://www.dnd5eapi.co/api/2014/monsters/baboon', 'https://5e14.dnd.su/bestiary/326-baboon/', 0),
