(354, 'giant-sea-horse', 'Giant Sea Horse', 'Гигантский морской конек', 'large', 'beast', 13, 16, '3d10', 'walk 0 ft., swim 40 ft.', 15, 0.5, '1/2', 100, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{"name":"Ram","desc":"Melee Weapon Attack: +3 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 4 (1d6 + 1) bludgeoning damage.","attack_bonus":3,"damage":"1d6+1 bludgeoning"}]', 'Like their smaller kin, giant sea horses are shy, colorful fish with elongated bodies and curled tails. Aquatic elves train them as mounts.', 'https://www.dnd5eapi.co/api/2014/monsters/giant-sea-horse', 'https://5e14.dnd.su/bestiary/354-giant-sea-horse/', 0),
