(75, 'vrock', 'Vrock', 'Врок', 'large', 'fiend', 15, 104, '11d10', 'walk 40 ft., fly 60 ft.', 15, 6, '6', 2300, '["cold","fire","lightning","bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing from nonmagical weapons"]', '["poison"]', '[]', '["poisoned"]', '[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The vrock makes two attacks: one with its beak and one with its talons."},{"name":"Beak","desc":"Melee Weapon Attack: +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) piercing damage.","attack_bonus":6,"damage":"2d6+3 piercing"},{"name":"Talons","desc":"Melee Weapon Attack: +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 14 (2d10 + 3) slashing damage.","attack_bonus":6,"damage":"2d10+3 slashing"},{"name":"Spores","desc":"A 15-foot-radius cloud of toxic spores extends out from the vrock. The spores spread around corners. Each creature in that area must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or become poisoned. While poisoned in this way, a target takes 5 (1d10) poison damage at the start of each of its turns. A target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Emptying a vial of holy water on the target also ends the effect on it."},{"name":"Stunning Screech","desc":"The vrock emits a horrific screech. Each creature within 20 feet of it that can hear it and that isn''t a demon must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or be stunned until the end of the vrock''s next turn ."}]', 'Magic Resistance. The vrock has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.', 'https://www.dnd5eapi.co/api/2014/monsters/vrock', 'https://5e14.dnd.su/bestiary/75-vrock/', 0),
